  "notes": [
    "Partial catalog. Actions and feedbacks are built at runtime from models.js and filtered by camera model and firmware major (utils.js:114-133, getModelActions); choices and ranges therefore depend on the connected camera. The catalog lists the actions with the widest ranges and records the model dependence in notes. Focus, exposure, white balance, audio, NDI and the remaining actions are not catalogued.",
    "Zoom and pan/tilt speed default and range values were not verified per camera model; panSpeed/tiltSpeed record the 0..255 advanced-mode range.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.12.1 (legacy style, options as arrays): no expressions; only the preset number text inputs use variables.",
    "Preset recall and save are text inputs with useVariables, checked at run time for an integer in the model range."
  ],
